{"id":"euclidean","title":"Euclidean distance","family":"lock-step","definition":"reference","intro_en":"Euclidean distance treats an aligned time series as one vector. Every vertical gap contributes a squared cost, and the final square root returns the result to the original amplitude units. The animation shows exactly which sample differences produce the final distance; no temporal realignment is performed.","intro_zh":"欧氏距离把已经对齐的时间序列视为向量。每个时刻的垂直差先平方后累加，再开平方回到原始幅值单位。动图展示各时刻如何贡献最终距离，整个计算不重新对齐时间。","steps_en":["Keep the two series on the same sample grid; no shift or warping is estimated.","Square each residual; the highlighted point supplies one coordinate contribution.","Accumulate the coordinate contributions in sample order.","Take the square root of the total squared gap."],"steps_zh":["在同一采样网格上比较两条序列，不估计平移或时间规整。","计算各坐标残差的平方。","按采样顺序累积局部贡献。","对平方差总和开平方。"],"formula":"sqrt(sum_i (x_i-y_i)^2)","caveats_en":["A single large residual can dominate the squared sum.","Sample alignment and amplitude units are part of the comparison protocol."],"caveats_zh":["单个大误差可能主导平方和。","采样对齐和幅值单位属于比较协议的一部分。"],"sources":[{"label":"SciPy: euclidean","url":"https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/generated/scipy.spatial.distance.euclidean.html"}],"x":[1.0,1.5,2.4,3.7,4.5,3.8,2.6,2.1,2.8,3.8,4.1,3.3],"y":[1.3,1.8,2.0,3.2,5.2,4.4,2.9,1.6,2.6,3.1,4.4,3.9],"input_label":"Deterministic synthetic illustration; sample index is the time axis.","parameters":{"samples":12,"preprocessing":"none","domain":"strictly positive illustration"},"result":{"label":"distance","value":1.661324772583615,"detail":"Exact formula evaluation on the displayed aligned vectors."},"frames":[{"phase":0,"caption":"Aligned samples","panel":{"kind":"lines","title":"Aligned samples","a":[1.0,1.5],"a_label":"x","b":[1.3,1.8],"b_label":"y","marker":1}},{"phase":0,"caption":"Aligned samples","panel":{"kind":"lines","title":"Aligned samples","a":[1.0,1.5,2.4,3.7,4.5],"a_label":"x","b":[1.3,1.8,2.0,3.2,5.2],"b_label":"y","